        ["Dalzakk (S)"] = {
            ["icon"] = "CampaignArbiter.png",
            ["note"] = "Notes:\
*  Dalzakk appears in the present during various cutscenes. * Battle Cry: Hiiiiii-yah! * Uses a powerful One Inch Punch every few seconds instead of meleeing. * When near defeat, Oggbi may appear and assist him. Maruna-Kurina's Notes: Ahhh, the wandering monk, said to have been trained in hand-to-hand combat by the legendary-wary Oggbi himself. He's known far and wide for his adventures and exploitarus. He can be seen running about Sauromugue Champaign as part of his daily regimen. He's a sucker for high morale, and can barely contain himself once the conversation-wation turns to the topic of war. They say battle fever is contagious, you know. And he's always willing to talk it up with a fellow monk. A powerful ally, indeed. Keep an eye on the heroism gauge with this one. He's an animal! How to Influence: *Talk to him with Monk as your main job. \"As you can see, I still have many malms to tread before my training is complete. Perhaps one day our paths will cross again on the fields of battle. Until then, friend.\" When Allied: \"I have rested long enough. It is time for me to make my master proud.\" \"Fear not. My fists will guide us to victory.\" *When allied with San d'Oria, Dalzakk roams Victory Square and Pikeman's Way in Southern San d'Oria (S). *When allied with Bastok, Dalzakk roams the area near the Rye Bridge in Bastok Markets (S). *When allied with Windurst, Dalzakk roams Huntsman's Court in Windurst Waters (S).",
